          question: 'What is the best treatment for back pain in Dubai?',
          answer: 'The best back pain treatment depends on the underlying cause, severity, and duration of symptoms. Physiotherapy, posture correction, rehabilitation exercises, and electrotherapy are commonly recommended for long-term pain relief and improved mobility.'
