      paragraph1: "A slip disc — also called a slipped disc or herniated disc — happens when one of the cushion-like discs between your spine bones is pushed out of its normal position, sometimes pressing on a nearby nerve. According to the Mayo Clinic, a herniated disc most often affects the lower back, though it can occur in the neck as well. It's one of the most common reasons people in Dubai search for reliable Slip Disc Treatment Dubai options — whether they call Slipped Disc Treatment Dubai or Herniated Disc Treatment Dubai — especially given how much time many residents spend driving or sitting at a desk.",
      paragraph2: "Prompt treatment matters because untreated nerve irritation can lead to worsening pain, numbness, or weakness over time. Patients typically notice back or neck pain, along with pain that travels into an arm or leg, tingling, or a feeling of weakness in a limb. Early diagnosis makes a real difference — the sooner the underlying issue is identified, the sooner a physiotherapy program can begin addressing it, which generally supports a smoother and faster recovery."
