      earlyTreatment: {
        title: "Why Slip Disc Treatment Dubai Should Start Early",
        paragraph: "Each disc sits between two vertebrae and acts as a shock absorber, made up of a tough outer ring and a soft, gel-like center. Discs allow the spine to bend and twist while cushioning the bones from impact. When a disc is damaged, its ability to cushion and protect nearby nerves is reduced, which is often what triggers pain. The World Health Organization identifies low back pain as one of the leading causes of disability worldwide, which is one reason starting treatment early matters."
      },
